      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. to make the argument really hit home, how should i frame the \"readiness\" aspect of it? like, was there a way to argue that these regions were essentially unorganized or lacked the necessary structure to modernize on their own before the colonial administration stepped in to provide that \"blueprint\" you mentioned?",
